addContent [SimTalk]
Adds the specified material to the existing content of the Mixer designated by <Path>.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.addContent(Amount:real[, Material:string, MaterialsTable:path])
Parameters
You can specify the following parameters:
• The parameter Amount of data type real designates the amount of material.
• The optional parameter Material of data type string designates the material.
Do not specify the optional parameter Material, to increase the existing amount of the contained
(single) educt or the contained product after the mixing operation respectively by the specified amount.
Specify the optional parameter Material to add the specified amount of the new educt to the content
in the Mixer during the filling process. After the mixing process the specified amount is added and the
specified material replaces the currently existing product.
• The optional parameter MaterialsTable of data type path designates the path to the MaterialsTable.
Example
Tank1.addContent(3, "MyProduct", .Fluids.MaterialsTable)
SimTalk
MaterialsTable
